OL,3,GNEWSAData centre raises noise and
OL,4,Awildlife impact fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FA huge data centre planned in a village
OL,7,Fnear a nature reserve would generate
OL,8,F"very high noise levels" without
OL,9,Fextensive measures to block it, experts
OL,10,Fhave said.
OL,12,FPlans have been submitted to South
OL,13,FNorfolk Council for a 150 megawatt
OL,14,Ffacility in Keswick on the edge of
OL,15,FNorwich, which includes assessments of
OL,16,Fits potential environmental impact.
OL,18,FThe scheme is causing concern, with
OL,19,Fthousands of people signing a petition
OL,20,Fagainst it, due to fears it could harm
OL,21,Fneighbouring wildlife sites.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB E Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,378,370,200,160,0,100
