OL,3,GNEWSAData centre raises noise and
OL,4,Awildlife impact fears
OL,5,
OL,6,FBut Norwich Apex Data Centre has
OL,7,Fdefended the scheme, claiming
OL,8,Fassessments showed it would not harm
OL,9,Fprotected areas like Marston Marshes.
